minutemen-heavy-kit-heavyshield-name = Heavy Shield
minutemen-heavy-kit-heavyshield-description = You are the blade and shield of the Minutemen. Make sure your squad comes back alive. Requires at least 8 Strength to use this kit's shield and blade; wielding both together requires 9 Strength. Contains: a paladin greatshield, a salvaged vertibird blade, Psycho, two stimpaks, an MRE box, and heavy trooper armor. Also includes a night-vision trooper helmet.
minutemen-heavy-kit-medicalspecialist-name = Medical Specialist
minutemen-heavy-kit-medicalspecialist-description = You aren't the strongest, but you are sure smart! Help keep your squad alive! Contains: light trooper armor, a loaded advanced 12.7mm SMG, a loaded magnum revolver, a stocked medical belt, an N14 health scanner, a CPR training manual, two filled combat medkits, an MRE box, boxes of 12.7mm and .44 magnum ammunition, two spare top-mounted 12.7mm SMG magazines, and two .44 magnum speedloaders. Also includes a medical specialist thermal-pulse helmet.
minutemen-heavy-kit-riotspecialist-name = Riot Specialist
minutemen-heavy-kit-riotspecialist-description = You know how to handle large groups. Push them back! Contains: a paladin shield, a Minutemen trooper cutlass, a loaded blowback shotgun, two boxes of 12-gauge shells, medium trooper armor, two stimpaks, a smoke grenade, a tear gas grenade, and an MRE box. Also includes a night-vision trooper helmet.
